7), and platelets 104,000/mm
3 (n.v. 130,000–400,000); other
laboratory investigations were normal: thyroid hormones, se-
rum copper and ceruloplasmin, serum lactate and pyruvate,
search for achantocytes, rheumatoid factor, LE phenomenon,
lupus anticoagulant, anticardiolipine antibodies, anti- Borrelia
